  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DSIF - Mozambique - Reinforcement and Extension of the National Power Transmission Grid</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide access to energy through reinforcement and extension of the national power transmission grid. The government&#x2019;s strategy for poverty reduction includes a focus on creating new jobs, increasing productivity and developing the private sector. These strategic aims all require a functional and nationwide energy infrastructure. The project includes construction of new power lines, extending the reach of the grid and improving substations.</narrative>
  </description>
